  "id": "reflexivity",
  "term": "reflexivity",
  "definition": "In a team setting, reflexivity is the deliberate process of members thinking about and discussing their goals, strategies, and way of working, then changing these when needed. It is a form of collaborative self-examination meant to improve how the group functions and the results it achieves.",
